{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the foundational mechanics of <i>Nigredo</i> in this standalone demo. You\u2019ll get an early look at the base-building, worker management, and resource-balancing systems that power this science-and-alchemy-driven strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo, you\u2019ll begin your journey managing a small scientific outpost. You'll build essential rooms, assign workers, and balance two core forces <i>Nigredo</i>  and <i>Albedo</i>\u00a0to keep your operations running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Early Base Expansion</strong> \u2013 Build and upgrade a limited set of rooms including storage, labs, and living quarters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Worker Assignment</strong> \u2013 Manage  workforce by assigning roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Systems</strong> \u2013 Balance inputs and outputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tech Progression</strong> \u2013 Research upgrades to enhance your base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supported Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Languages:</strong> English (interface only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Modes:</strong> Single-player only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Input:</strong> Keyboard and mouse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a vertical slice of the full game\u2019s management experience and does <strong>not</strong> include the full tech tree.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691660?t=1747251088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691660?t=1747251088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s